 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "logs maps each serverId to its list of events; each event is an object with integer \"time\", string \"type\" and optionally string \"target\"; each list is sorted by time. Return one list of all events ordered by time, ties broken by serverId (string order) and then by position in that server's list. Each output event is a new object with \"serverId\" added to its fields (\"target\" appears only when present in the input).",
